# Objects built into the app. Only one file defining appMain() may be built.
#
# Built:
#   cavebat_mission.o        the app (appMain): take off; hover, or follow a
#                            wall out and retrace the route home; land. Records
#                            at 1 Hz onboard, downloads over CRTP port 14.
#   cavebat_multiranger.o    Multi-ranger deck driver with a more robust init,
#                            replacing the stock one (CONFIG_DECK_MULTIRANGER=n
#                            in app-config). Not an appMain.
#   wallfollowing_corners.o  wall follower called by cavebat_mission.c. Not an
#                            appMain, but required by it.
#
# Kept in the tree, not built:
#   cavebat_record.o                     older app: hover flight + recording.
#   wallfollowing_tudelft.o              TU Delft SGBA follower; not called.
#   wallfollowing_multiranger_onboard.o  Bitcraze demo follower; not called.
#   cavebat_wall.o                       older wall-following app; never flown.
#   cavebat.o                            older app: hover flight, no recording.
#   cavebat_i2cscan.o                    I2C bus scan diagnostic; does not fly.
#   cavebat_v2.c, cavebat_v3.c           older apps; not listed below.
# obj-y += cavebat_record.o
obj-y += cavebat_mission.o
obj-y += cavebat_multiranger.o
obj-y += wallfollowing_corners.o
# obj-y += wallfollowing_tudelft.o
# obj-y += wallfollowing_multiranger_onboard.o
# obj-y += cavebat_wall.o
# obj-y += cavebat.o
# obj-y += cavebat_i2cscan.o
